<section id="next" class="border-t border-line bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:py-28">
    <div class=" max-w-[65ch]">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter md:text-5xl">What I am building next.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        One long term research goal, plus an open slot for whatever I ship this term. New projects appear here automatically.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="card border border-accent/25 bg-emerald-50 p-8">
        <i class="ph ph-brain text-3xl text-accent" aria-hidden="true" />
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Repository aware code intelligence</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
          A long term goal: tools that read a whole repo, not one file, and help evaluate how well AI coding agents handle real code.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">Status: reading and planning</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card border border-dashed border-line bg-paper p-8">
        <i class="ph ph-plus-circle text-3xl text-muted" aria-hidden="true" />
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Your next project goes here</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
          This slot stays empty on purpose. When the next build ships, it gets a full case study like the one above.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">Status: open</p>
      </article>
    </div>
